{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10133030","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10133030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1013303001:0":{"text":"다들 잘 지내셨어요? 제가 왔어요!","source_cn":"见到大家可太高兴啦！我平安到来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BD7DC35E960E43D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013303002:0":{"text":"여러분이 페이를 데리고 와준 건가요? 감사합니다!","source_cn":"就是你们护送菲一路过来的吗？太感谢了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC9CC02ED22E269C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013303003:0":{"text":"페이가 제때 도착할 거라고 기대도 안 했는데, 정말 큰 도움이 되겠어요...!","source_cn":"我们本来没指望菲能如期到达的，这下帮了大忙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31064263C676F04F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013303004:0":{"text":"궁금한 게 있으시다고 페이에게 전해 들었어요. 지식 공유는 언제나 환영이니 영지 내에서 편하게 물어보세요!","source_cn":"菲说你们有想知道的事？请在营地内随意询问，我们很愿意分...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A2C3B7019B79618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:菲":{"text":"페이","source":"菲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尔":{"text":"사울","source":"索尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}